  (text "EXTERNAL CONVERTER CONTROLLER / ENGINEERING CHECKPOINT - NOT FOR POWER-UP"
    (at 25.4 19.05 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f6a9218e-f422-43f2-90d0-c5e3145cbe7a")
  )
  (text "Logic: USB or protected 1S only. Power converter is external; no LM5164 or BQ25756 fitted.\nUse J1 (DC) OR J8 (3-phase), never both. Input/output ratings and thermal capability remain unqualified."
    (at 25.4 76.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "485b6b9c-5275-417c-a2f7-a7af9c5b394f")
  )
  (text "Input and output monitors share one I2C bus (0x40 / 0x41). GPIO20 is spare.\nAll GND references are common: this controller does not isolate PC / converter / receiver.\nPCB routing and external CC/CV interface qualification remain work in progress."
    (at 25.4 251.46 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "83bc4d1f-56ca-48e9-9b67-d26c472a9442")
  )
  (text "CC/CV: direct MCP42100 100k A/W/B headers. No automatic mechanical fallback.\nPower logic and initialize both codes before enabling the external converter. Stop converter before logic power loss."
    (at 25.4 264.16 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c0246aab-2bab-47c4-b763-bb61321105a2")
  )
